Subject: [PATCH 0214/1695] dts: stm32: enable USART2 node on stm32mp257f-ev1
 board

Enable this node to enable the console configuration.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git b5fdce562ceecba5c5858ccc4ea1ecbce9f917a6 dts: stm32: enable USART2 node on stm32mp257f-ev1 board]
Change-Id: If389560f8eb9fea4321aae3fb60b828ee62f8065
Signed-off-by: Gatien Chevallier <gatien.chevallier@foss.st.com>
---
 core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp257f-ev1.dts | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp257f-ev1.dts b/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp257f-ev1.dts
index 5857f04c0..d51c81be9 100644
--- a/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp257f-ev1.dts
+++ b/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp257f-ev1.dts
@@ -28,3 +28,9 @@
 		reg = <0x0 0x80000000 0x1 0x00000000>;
 	};
 };
+
+&usart2 {
+	pinctrl-names = "default";
+	pinctrl-0 = <&usart2_pins_a>;
+	status = "okay";
+};
